[en.FOCUS_C12_PROMOTE_PAIRING_STONE]
Promote Pairing Stone

[en.FOCUS_C12_PROMOTE_PAIRING_STONE_desc]
The term "Conjugal Stones" may be unfamiliar to most ponies; however, for those at the rock farm, it is a well-known concept. These small stones are believed to possess peculiar magical properties. While skeptics may dismiss such notions, it is undeniable that the Pie sisters’ parents, Igneous Rock Pie and Cloudy Quartz, swiftly found their lifelong partners under the guidance of a Conjugal Stone. Their parents, as well as many other ponies living on the rock farm, have had similar experiences.\n\nWe can compile and publicize these accounts related to Conjugal Stones, packaging them as a unique product to promote among ponies throughout the region. This initiative would encourage more ponies to quickly find their significant others, thereby increasing our birth rate.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PROMOTE_PAIRING_STONE]
推广姻缘石

[zh.FOCUS_C12_PROMOTE_PAIRING_STONE_desc]
姻缘石这个名词对大多数小马来说都比较陌生，然而采石农场的小马而言，这再令马熟悉不过了，这种小小的石头蕴含着奇怪的魔力，虽然不信者对此嗤之以鼻，但是不可否认的是，派家姐妹的父母火岩派和云母正是在一颗姻缘石的指引下迅速找到他们的毕生所爱，而他们的父母乃至许多其他生活在采石农场的小马都是如此。我们可以将有关姻缘石的事迹整理下来并宣传，包装成一种特殊的产品推广给整个地区的小马，鼓励更多的小马迅速找到他们的另一半来提高我们的出生率。

